<title>GREECE: NATWEST'S HASAPIS TO HEAD ABN-AMRO'S FX DESK.</title>
<headline>NATWEST'S HASAPIS TO HEAD ABN-AMRO'S FX DESK.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thanos Hasapis, formerly with NatWest Bank, Athens, will be the new chief forex dealer at ABN-AMRO Bank, Athens, effective June 17, bank sources told Reuters.</p>
<p>Hasapis, 30, holds an MS degree from Columbia University in New York and is a member of the board of Greece's forex club. --Dimitris Kontogiannis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
